<section class="phero"><img class="phero-bg" src="/assets/img/photos/estimate-calculator.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/estimate-calculator-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/estimate-calculator.webp 960w" sizes="100vw" width="960" height="601" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">›</span>Free tools</nav><p class="tag">Free &amp; private</p><h1>Free Property Claim Tools for Rhode Island Owners</h1><p class="lede">7 calculators and planners built from real appraisal work. Check the carrier’s math, plan your deadlines and sort out a coastal loss, with no sign-up and nothing stored.</p></div></section>
<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="pgrid seven"><a class="pcard rv" href="/policyholder-tools/settlement-gap-estimator/"><span class="pcard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/estimate-calculator.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/estimate-calculator-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/estimate-calculator.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="960" height="601" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="pcard-k">Estimator</span></span><span class="pcard-b"><h2>Settlement Gap Estimator</h2><p>See the disputed amount, a projected award and what appraisal fees would leave you.</p><span class="more">Open the tool <svg class="ic" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/policyholder-tools/rcv-acv-holdback-calculator/"><span class="pcard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/insurance-paperwork.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/insurance-paperwork-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/insurance-paperwork.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="pcard-k">Calculator</span></span><span class="pcard-b"><h2>RCV / ACV Holdback Calculator</h2><p>Itemize depreciation and see the first payment, the holdback and the total once repairs are done.</p><span class="more">Open the tool <svg class="ic" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/policyholder-tools/roof-area-pitch-converter/"><span class="pcard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/roofer-at-work.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roofer-at-work-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roofer-at-work.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="pcard-k">Calculator</span></span><span class="pcard-b"><h2>Roof Area &amp; Pitch Converter</h2><p>Turn a footprint and pitch into roof squares, waste, bundles and a rough replacement cost.</p><span class="more">Open the tool <svg class="ic" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/policyholder-tools/hurricane-deductible-calculator/"><span class="pcard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/storm-surf.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/storm-surf-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/storm-surf.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="960" height="639" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="pcard-k">Calculator</span></span><span class="pcard-b"><h2>Hurricane Deductible Calculator</h2><p>Convert a percentage hurricane deductible into dollars and compare it with your standard deductible.</p><span class="more">Open the tool <svg class="ic" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/policyholder-tools/claim-timeline-builder/"><span class="pcard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/inspector-clipboard.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/inspector-clipboard-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/inspector-clipboard.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="1024" height="678" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="pcard-k">Planner</span></span><span class="pcard-b"><h2>Claim Timeline Builder</h2><p>Build a dated list of claim milestones from your date of loss and download it as a calendar file.</p><span class="more">Open the tool <svg class="ic" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/policyholder-tools/appraisal-readiness-checkup/"><span class="pcard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/consultation-table.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/consultation-table-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/consultation-table.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="pcard-k">Checklist</span></span><span class="pcard-b"><h2>Appraisal Readiness Checkup</h2><p>Twelve yes-or-no questions that score how prepared your file is for an appraisal panel.</p><span class="more">Open the tool <svg class="ic" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/policyholder-tools/wind-flood-damage-splitter/"><span class="pcard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/flood-cleanup.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/flood-cleanup-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/flood-cleanup.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="1024" height="681" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="pcard-k">Organizer</span></span><span class="pcard-b"><h2>Wind vs. Flood Damage Splitter</h2><p>Sort a coastal storm loss into wind and flood portions, apply each deductible and see what each policy might pay.</p><span class="more">Open the tool <svg class="ic" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec stone"><div class="wrap split top"><div class="rv"><p class="tag dark">Suggested order</p><h2>Using the tools together</h2><ol class="order"><li>Start with the <a href="/policyholder-tools/claim-timeline-builder/">claim timeline builder</a> so nothing lapses.</li><li>After a coastal storm, sort the loss with the <a href="/policyholder-tools/wind-flood-damage-splitter/">wind vs. flood splitter</a>.</li><li>Check roof quantities with the <a href="/policyholder-tools/roof-area-pitch-converter/">roof area &amp; pitch converter</a>.</li><li>See what you’re actually owed with the <a href="/policyholder-tools/hurricane-deductible-calculator/">hurricane deductible</a> and <a href="/policyholder-tools/rcv-acv-holdback-calculator/">RCV / ACV</a> calculators.</li><li>Test the dispute with the <a href="/policyholder-tools/settlement-gap-estimator/">settlement gap estimator</a>, then take the <a href="/policyholder-tools/appraisal-readiness-checkup/">readiness checkup</a>.</li></ol></div><div class="rv"><div class="box box-call"><h2 class="box-t">Talk it through</h2><p>A free first conversation. We’ll tell you plainly whether appraisal fits your claim.</p><a class="box-phone" href="tel:+18445371427">+1 (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn ink" href="/request-a-claim-review/">Send claim details</a></div></div></div></section>
